// Español (Latinoamérica). Each line: "English text as the app shows it": "translation".
// A {word} matches anything (a name, a number) and is put back in the translation's {word}.
// Missing lines stay in English. To check what's still missing, run the app with
// CUEVIDEO_LANG=es and CUEVIDEO_LANG_MISSING=<file>; every untranslated text shown is written there.
